Data
----

MNIST is the database of handwritten digits by Yann LeCun, Corinna Cortes,
and Christopher J.C. Burges. The bundled file public/data/mnist_subset.bin.gz
is a preprocessed subset produced by tools/make_mnist_subset.py.
